WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:06.291
Every Christmas we say: next year.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.031
So this year, I actually asked.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:29.431
Most of what I found was noise. This was the first thing that made sense.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:39.643
We knew roughly what we could spend. We didn't know where it would take us.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:45.379
I didn't want a sales pitch. I wanted someone to explain it.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.662
Two weeks later, we were walking through our future home. From our sofa.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:11.491
A lawyer. A tax adviser who knew both countries. A bank. A notary. Introduced one at a time.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.468
And then, one summer…

00:01:31.100 --> 00:01:33.810
…next year finally came.
